# HabitsPage Implementation Roadmap

This document provides a step-by-step guide to implementing the new HabitsPage architecture. Follow these steps in sequence to build out the full functionality.

## Phase 1: Setup and Utilities

### Step 1: Create Basic Folder Structure
```
mkdir -p src/components/Habits/Pages
mkdir -p src/components/Habits/Views
mkdir -p src/components/Habits/DragAndDrop
mkdir -p src/components/Habits/Containers
mkdir -p src/components/Habits/UI
mkdir -p src/components/Habits/utils
```

### Step 2: Implement Utility Files

#### dateUtils.js (Priority: High)
- Implement the basic date functions
- Test with different date scenarios
- Ensure timezone handling is consistent

#### activityUtils.js (Priority: High)
- Implement the activity processing functions
- Test with sample activity data
- Ensure correct period assignment

#### dragUtils.js (Priority: Medium)
- Implement reordering utilities
